IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P3-section-3`
IMPORT `P3-art-20`
IMPORT `P3-art-21`

-- Tests of Articles 20 and 21. Expected values are written from the text before the run.
-- "immediately" (Art 20) is read as the same day (WITHIN 0 on a clock of whole days): an act on day 0 is in time, an act on day 1 is not.

§ `Fixtures`

`P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 12 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 12 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027 and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE

`P3 system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 plain circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 Section B circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS TRUE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 equivalent protection circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS TRUE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS TRUE



§ `Art 20(1): corrective actions`

-- args: the provider considers or has reason to consider the system not in conformity; it has taken the necessary corrective actions
#ASSERT `Art 20(1) the provider has taken the necessary corrective actions` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 20(1) the provider has taken the necessary corrective actions` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 20(1) the provider has taken the necessary corrective actions` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 20(1) the provider has taken the necessary corrective actions` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 20(1) the provider has taken the necessary corrective actions` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 20(1) the provider has taken the necessary corrective actions` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 20(1) the provider has taken the necessary corrective actions` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 20(1): informing the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers`

-- args: the trigger; distributors informed; deployers exist; informed; a representative exists; informed; importers exist; informed
#ASSERT `Art 20(1) the provider has informed the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Only distributors exist as recipients: the three "where applicable" recipients are not required.
#ASSERT `Art 20(1) the provider has informed the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 20(1) the provider has informed the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 20(1) the provider has informed the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 20(1) the provider has informed the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 20(1) the provider has informed the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 20(1) the provider has informed the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 20(1) the provider has informed the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

