#ASSERT `Art 20(2) the provider has investigated the causes of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 20(2) the provider has investigated the causes of the risk` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 20(2): informing the market surveillance authorities and, where applicable, the notified body`

-- args: risk; aware; informed the market surveillance authorities (nature of the non-compliance, corrective action); a notified body issued a certificate; informed that notified body
