#ASSERT `Art 20(2) the provider has informed the market surveillance authorities and, where applicable, the notified body` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 20(2) the provider has informed the market surveillance authorities and, where applicable, the notified body` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 20(2) the provider has informed the market surveillance authorities and, where applicable, the notified body` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 21(1): information and documentation upon a reasoned request`

-- args: a reasoned request; all the information and documentation provided; in a language the authority easily understands; that language is an official language of the Union institutions indicated by the Member State
#ASSERT `Art 21(1) the provider has provided the competent authority the information and documentation upon a reasoned request` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 21(1) the provider has provided the competent authority the information and documentation upon a reasoned request` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 21(1) the provider has provided the competent authority the information and documentation upon a reasoned request` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 21(1) the provider has provided the competent authority the information and documentation upon a reasoned request` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- No reasoned request: the duty is not triggered (NOTHING-kind: "upon a reasoned request").
#ASSERT `Art 21(1) the provider has provided the competent authority the information and documentation upon a reasoned request` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 21(1) the provider has provided the competent authority the information and documentation upon a reasoned request` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 21(1) the provider has provided the competent authority the information and documentation upon a reasoned request` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 21(2): access to the logs upon a reasoned request, to the extent under the provider's control`

-- args: a reasoned request; the logs are under the provider's control; access given
#ASSERT `Art 21(2) the provider has given the requesting competent authority access to the automatically generated logs` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 21(2) the provider has given the requesting competent authority access to the automatically generated logs` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 21(2) the provider has given the requesting competent authority access to the automatically generated logs` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 21(2) the provider has given the requesting competent authority access to the automatically generated logs` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 21(2) the provider has given the requesting competent authority access to the automatically generated logs` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 21(3): information obtained pursuant to this Article is treated in accordance with Article 78`

#ASSERT `Art 21(3) the information obtained by a competent authority is to be treated in accordance with the confidentiality obligations set out in Article 78` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 21(3) the information obtained by a competent authority is to be treated in accordance with the confidentiality obligations set out in Article 78` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 21(3) the information obtained by a competent authority is to be treated in accordance with the confidentiality obligations set out in Article 78` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Traces: Article 20 (the duties that fall due "immediately" can be breached) and Article 21 (no time limit)`

-- Art 20(1): an act on the day the provider considers (day 0) is in time; on day 1 it is late.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 20(1) the provider's duty to take the necessary corrective actions immediately` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 20(1) take the necessary corrective actions to bring the high-risk AI system into conformity, to withdraw it, to disable it, or to recall it, as appropriate` AT 0
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 20(1) the provider's duty to take the necessary corrective actions immediately` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 20(1) take the necessary corrective actions to bring the high-risk AI system into conformity, to withdraw it, to disable it, or to recall it, as appropriate` AT 1
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 20(1) the provider's duty to take the necessary corrective actions immediately` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 1
-- No reason to consider the system not in conformity: nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 20(1) the provider's duty to take the necessary corrective actions immediately` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 20(1) the provider's duty to take the necessary corrective actions immediately` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- Art 20(1) second sentence: no time limit stated.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 20(1) the provider's duty to inform the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 20(1) inform the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 20(1) the provider's duty to inform the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 20(1) the provider's duty to inform the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
