    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 20(2) investigate the causes of the risk, in collaboration with the reporting deployer, where applicable` AT 1
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 20(2) the provider's duty to investigate the causes of the risk immediately` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 20(2) the provider's duty to investigate the causes of the risk immediately` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 20(2) the provider's duty to inform the market surveillance authorities and, where applicable, the notified body immediately` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 20(2) inform the market surveillance authorities and, where applicable, the notified body` AT 0
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 20(2) the provider's duty to inform the market surveillance authorities and, where applicable, the notified body immediately` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
