-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 20(2) the provider's duty to inform the market surveillance authorities and, where applicable, the notified body immediately` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- Art 2(2): cut off for an Article 6(1) system with Section B products.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 20(2) the provider's duty to inform the market surveillance authorities and, where applicable, the notified body immediately` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
